# Encoding is pinned in .editorconfig (charset = utf-8) — that is what prevents
# a repeat of the mojibake that hit the Travels/ files. This file only keeps git
# from treating binaries as text.
#
# Deliberately absent: `text=auto` and any `eol=` directive. The working tree is
# CRLF throughout, so declaring either would rewrite every file in the repo and
# bury real changes under a whole-project diff.

*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.webm  binary
*.zip   binary
